              <div class="job-header">
                <div class="company">Aurin (Sodio)</div>
                <div class="location">Cuernavaca, Morelos</div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="projects-grid">
                <div class="project-card">
                  <h4>MonexOne App Design</h4>
                  <p>Designed mobile UX/UI for MonexOne, collaborating with Ancient Technologies for Mexican and US markets. Implemented atomic design system from UX phase, actively participating in post-design product design and development.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="project-card">
                  <h4>Fintpay WebApp UX/UI Design</h4>
